    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτηγ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for carrying loads,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖα φ.</span> ships <i>of burden,
				merchantmen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.88
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. βρώματα</span> provisions <i>such as
				are used in these ships,</i> i. e. sorry fare, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.Com.
				2.42
			</span></i>.</div>
